       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          WHO.
       AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        7/1/83.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
       SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.   THIS SUBPROGRAM EMULATES THE HP 'WHO' INTRINSIC
      *           AND RETURNS THE VALUES IN THE SAME PARAMETERS AS
      *           AS THAT INTRINSIC.  FOR TERMINAL NUM, THIS SUBPROG
      *           RETURNS THE NUMERIC PART OF THE DISPLAY NAME,
      *           IE 'DSP43' WOULD RETURN 43 AS THE TERMINAL NUM.
      *
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  I                       PIC 9(2)  COMP-3.
       77  J                       PIC 9(2)  COMP-3.
       77  DIGIT-COUNT             PIC 9(2)  COMP-3.
       77  NUM-ZEROES              PIC 9(2)  COMP-3.
       77  CONV-TNUM               PIC 9(10).
       77  JOB-TYPE                PIC X(1).

       01  IBM-USERNAME            PIC X(10).
       01  IBM-TERMINAL.
           05  IBM-TERM-BYTE OCCURS 10 TIMES PIC X(1).
       01  IBM-CURLIB              PIC X(10).

       01  BUILD-TNUM.
           05  BLD-TNUM-BYTE OCCURS 10 TIMES PIC X(1).

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  MOD                     PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
       01  CAP                     PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
       01  LATTR                   PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
       01  USERNAME                PIC X(8).
       01  GRPNAME                 PIC X(8).
       01  ACCTNAME                PIC X(8).
       01  HOMEGRP                 PIC X(8).
       01  TNUM                    PIC S9(4) COMP-4.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING MOD, CAP, LATTR, USERNAME,
                                GRPNAME, ACCTNAME, HOMEGRP, TNUM.

       6-MAIN.
           CALL "CLWHO" USING IBM-USERNAME, IBM-TERMINAL,
             IBM-CURLIB, JOB-TYPE.

      *------ FOR JOB TYPE, IN IBM, 0 = BATCH, 1 = INTERACTIVE
      *------ FOR HP, 8 = JOB, 7 = INTERACTIVE.  SINCE THIS IS
      *------ EMULATING THE HP CALL, CONVERT TO THE STRANGE HP MODE.
           IF JOB-TYPE = "0"
               MOVE 8 TO MOD
           ELSE
               MOVE 7 TO MOD.
           MOVE 0 TO CAP, LATTR, DIGIT-COUNT.
           MOVE IBM-USERNAME TO USERNAME.
           MOVE IBM-CURLIB TO GRPNAME, ACCTNAME, HOMEGRP.

           MOVE 11 TO I.
           MOVE 11 TO J.
           PERFORM 7010-MOVE-TERM-BYTES 10 TIMES.
           SUBTRACT DIGIT-COUNT FROM 10 GIVING NUM-ZEROES.
           IF NUM-ZEROES > 10
               MOVE 10 TO NUM-ZEROES.
           MOVE 0 TO I.
           PERFORM 7020-ZERO-OUT NUM-ZEROES TIMES.
           MOVE BUILD-TNUM TO CONV-TNUM.
           MOVE CONV-TNUM TO TNUM.

           GOBACK.

       7010-MOVE-TERM-BYTES.
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM I.
           IF IBM-TERM-BYTE (I) >= "0" AND IBM-TERM-BYTE (I) <= "9"
               ADD 1 TO DIGIT-COUNT
               SUBTRACT 1 FROM J
               MOVE IBM-TERM-BYTE (I) TO BLD-TNUM-BYTE (J).

       7020-ZERO-OUT.
           ADD 1 TO I.
           MOVE "0" TO BLD-TNUM-BYTE (I).
